From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] e200: enable TUN and bridge networking for Charon

Charon carries Ethernet frames through a TAP device and bridges the
batman-adv interface with usb0.  Keep these core interfaces built in so the
SD-card image does not depend on a separate module load for TUN/bridge.
---
 arch/arm/configs/zynq_e200_defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/configs/zynq_e200_defconfig b/arch/arm/configs/zynq_e200_defconfig
index 000000000000..111111111111 100644
--- a/arch/arm/configs/zynq_e200_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/zynq_e200_defconfig
@@ -63,6 +63,12 @@ CONFIG_NET=y
 CONFIG_PACKET=y
 CONFIG_UNIX=y
 CONFIG_INET=y
+CONFIG_TUN=y
+CONFIG_BRIDGE=y
+CONFIG_BATMAN_ADV=y
+CONFIG_BATMAN_ADV_BATMAN_V=y
+CONFIG_BATMAN_ADV_BLA=y
+CONFIG_BATMAN_ADV_DAT=y
 CONFIG_IP_MULTICAST=y
 CONFIG_IP_PNP=y
 CONFIG_IP_PNP_DHCP=y
-- 
2.43.0
